ole I never imagined  how my life would change not only  because of the creative experience but  even more because of the personal  experience and the relationship that I  forged with Leonard and the relationship  that be fostered and nurtured in the  last eight years of his life  I was so fortunate enough to be a part  of it and now that he's gone I feel even  more grateful that that relationship has  led me to my relationship with this  family and I love them like my own and  they've been so incredible and carry on  his spirit in such beautiful ways and if  they are so wonderful and they're all  here tonight so many of them here  tonight his wife Susan and it really is  this is I don't know this is just such  an incredible moment because I know that  so many other young actors in the future  are going to be stumbling their way  around this lot and Leonard will guide  them in the way that he guided me and  I'm going to do that because we are  about to unveil and it is a great honor  than my privilege to officially open at  Paramount Studios Leonard Nimoy way so  let's raise a glass and hold it in our  hearts  yeah I already chose I said raising on  it all right  they did you guys are all witnessing a  little bit of history right here and you  are now going to be part of the  historical record of that if you all  look up at the scissor lift you can't  see pass the lights here we're taking a  photo commemorating it so everyone look  up and say me one  you
 

